The repository: Everything you need is here. Use it with any AI.

3
00:00:16.194 --> 00:00:22.603
The repository: Data, prompts, agent instructions, website: the same materials.

4
00:00:22.603 --> 00:00:27.212
Pick your route: A, B or C.

5
00:00:27.212 --> 00:00:33.618
Route A · Copy and paste: Click "Copy the screening prompt" on the Start page.

6
00:00:33.618 --> 00:00:42.623
Route A · Copy and paste: Records page: batch, "Copy batch", paste both into a chat.

7
00:00:42.623 --> 00:00:51.983
Route A · Copy and paste: The AI answers: check 20 records in, 20 rows out.

8
00:00:51.983 --> 00:00:59.475
Route B · Attach the files: Download the prompt from GitHub: prompts/03_screening.md.

9
00:00:59.475 --> 00:01:04.081
Route B · Attach the files: And the paper: "Download raw file".

10
00:01:04.081 --> 00:01:10.086
Route B · Attach the files: Records with abstracts: "Download as .txt" on the Records page.

11
00:01:10.086 --> 00:01:14.495
Route B · Attach the files: Attach the files to any assistant, then ask.

12
00:01:14.495 --> 00:01:20.901
Route C · Connect an agent: Clone it: the agent reads AGENTS.md and the skills.

13
00:01:20.901 --> 00:01:27.311
Route C · Connect an agent: A real agent run: two screenings, then compared.

14
00:01:27.311 --> 00:01:33.718
Route C · Connect an agent: Runs agree on 19 of 20; a human resolves R044.

15
00:01:33.718 --> 00:01:41.018
Route C · Connect an agent: Chat assistants with a GitHub connector can read it too.

16
00:01:41.018 --> 00:01:49.026
Whatever the route: check it: Paste the AI's decisions into the scorer: coverage first.

17
00:01:49.026 --> 00:01:53.431
Whatever the route: check it: 0 missed includes; open the flagged records yourself.

18
00:01:53.431 --> 00:02:00.236
Whatever the route: check it: Then find the AI's quote in the paper, word for word.

19
00:02:00.236 --> 00:02:05.849
